window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"riven","b":"masteryi","win":["Riven","Riven","Riven","Riven","Riven","Skill","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Level 1","text":"Q mobility and raw trade stats beat him outright — start winning immediately."},{"when":"Level 2","text":"Ki Burst interrupts Meditate — he loses the heal and the channel."},{"when":"Level 6","text":"Your R spike keeps the kill pressure firmly yours — force the all-in before his items."},{"when":"Yi two items","text":"His sustained DPS and resets now out-scale you; stop taking straight duels."}],"wants":{"you":["A kill lead banked before his first item","The stun saved for his Meditate cast","Fights ended before his resets chain"],"foe":["A quiet farm lane into his item spike","Alpha Strike through your burst","Late-game reset chains through your team"]},"early":"You beat him at every stage of laning: level-1 Q mobility and stats win outright, and from level 2 Ki Burst does double duty — it is a stun and it cancels Meditate, so his 10s channel heal never completes if you save the stun for it. Through 4-5 keep the trades short: Wuju Style puts true damage on his autos every 14s.","mid":"At 6 your Blade of the Exile spike keeps the kill pressure yours — force fights before his economy catches up. Wait for Alpha Strike before you commit: it is 20s at rank 1, it makes him untargetable mid-flight, and his basic attacks shave it down, so count his autos as well as the clock. Snowball plates and roams now.","late":"Late game his sustained DPS and Highlander out-scale you — a kill or assist extends it and refunds his other cooldowns. Do not duel him at full build; carry Grievous Wounds for Meditate, group, land the stun the instant he commits, and burst him inside the CC chain. Your job is starting fights clean.","whys":["Your level-1 Q mobility and trade stats beat him outright before he has anything online.","Ki Burst at 2 cancels Meditate outright — his channel heal dies to your stun.","At 3 the full Q-W-E combo lets you all-in and win whenever you choose.","Through 4-5 Wuju Style adds true damage on 14s — trade in bursts, never long.","At 6 your R spike keeps the kill pressure over his — the all-in threat is yours.","Highlander is 85s and makes him slow-immune — your Q3 knockback still lands on him.","Late his sustained DPS and R resets out-scale and delete you — answer with grouping and CC."]});
